// ochazuke bindings (JSONC): the Nouns page (noun_browser.go). No key opens the page: it is the last tab (nouns.page), and ochazuke.noun-browser.open runs from the palette and the CLI.
{
  "bindings": [
    {"context": "ochazuke.noun-browser/normal", "bindings": [
      {"key": "r", "action": "ochazuke.noun-browser.refresh"}
    ]}
  ]
}
